# SPEC: Geo2 v2 (Authority Graph First)

## Scope
- Runtime: Python-only
- Deterministic outputs from identical inputs/config
- Explicit versioned JSON schemas for all artifacts
- No UI and no database

## Input families
- Plain text files (Slice 1)
- Config files: territories, entity canonicals, query classes (Slice 2)
- Fixture LLM answer sets (Slice 4)
- Rule/template files (all slices)

## Output artifacts
- `/out/<basename>.json` and manifest for ingest output
- `/out/<run>/authority-graph.json` and manifest
- `/out/<run>/bias-payload.json` and manifest
- `/out/<run>/inclusion-index.json` and manifest
- `/out/<run>/reinforcement-brief.json`, `.md`, and manifest
